WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.854 --> 00:00:07.988
.

00:00:08.121 --> 00:00:11.925
&gt;&gt;&gt; A stunning visit inside

00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:13.160
Ukraine.

00:00:13.293 --> 00:00:15.095
Here's Vladimir Putin in the

00:00:15.228 --> 00:00:17.064
donbas region for the first time

00:00:17.197 --> 00:00:19.766
since rash invaded he touted the

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.034
Russian controlled city of

00:00:21.134 --> 00:00:22.269
mariupol and surveyed

00:00:22.402 --> 00:00:23.603
reconstruction programs after

00:00:23.737 --> 00:00:25.439
the damage inflicted by his

00:00:25.572 --> 00:00:26.073
military.

00:00:26.206 --> 00:00:28.008
His visit comes days after the

00:00:28.141 --> 00:00:29.810
international criminal court

00:00:29.943 --> 00:00:31.445
issued a warrant for his arrest

00:00:31.578 --> 00:00:33.680
for his role in an alleged

00:00:33.814 --> 00:00:35.716
scheme to deport thousands of

00:00:35.849 --> 00:00:38.218
Ukrainian children to Russia.

00:00:38.352 --> 00:00:41.054
For more let's bring in CNN

00:00:41.154 --> 00:00:42.089
military analyst lieutenant

00:00:42.222 --> 00:00:43.890
general mark hurt ling.

00:00:44.024 --> 00:00:46.126
Putin spent Saturday touring the

00:00:46.259 --> 00:00:48.028
streets he helped destroy in a

00:00:48.161 --> 00:00:50.364
country still deeply entrenched

00:00:50.497 --> 00:00:51.064
in war.

00:00:51.098 --> 00:00:51.898
What kind of message does that

00:00:52.032 --> 00:00:57.404
send both to his troops and the

00:00:57.537 --> 00:00:57.804
Ukrainians?

00:00:57.938 --> 00:01:01.074
&gt;&gt; He's trying to send a

00:01:01.174 --> 00:01:03.143
message Paula but have

00:01:03.276 --> 00:01:05.312
difficulties as you see in the

00:01:05.445 --> 00:01:06.013
pictures he was going through

00:01:06.146 --> 00:01:08.048
the one apartment building

00:01:08.181 --> 00:01:11.084
rebuilt sort of as a village, I

00:01:11.084 --> 00:01:12.452
don't use that loosely in the

00:01:12.586 --> 00:01:13.687
city of mariupol.

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:16.690
As you just said, that city was

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:18.058
utterly devastated by his

00:01:18.191 --> 00:01:19.393
shelling of civilian apartments

00:01:19.526 --> 00:01:20.660
and hospitals and schools and

00:01:21.094 --> 00:01:23.397
now he's going back to take a

00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:27.467
look around, and it's a photo

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:28.769
opt as you see him in this film

00:01:29.102 --> 00:01:31.505
in the middle of an apartment

00:01:31.638 --> 00:01:33.440
building he's trying to relocate

00:01:33.573 --> 00:01:35.642
some Ukrainian civilians, it's

00:01:35.776 --> 00:01:37.577
sending a signal because it's

00:01:37.711 --> 00:01:39.780
still very far to the west

00:01:39.913 --> 00:01:43.116
behind enemy lines.

00:01:43.116 --> 00:01:45.118
It's in the province -- the

00:01:45.185 --> 00:01:46.453
Russians have control of that

00:01:46.586 --> 00:01:47.120
province right now.

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:49.156
But I think we'll see in the

00:01:49.289 --> 00:01:50.490
coming months that that will be

00:01:51.958 --> 00:01:53.593
a targeted area for the

00:01:53.727 --> 00:01:55.328
Ukrainian counter offensive to

00:01:55.462 --> 00:01:57.597
take back their sovereign

00:01:57.731 --> 00:01:57.964
territory.

00:01:58.098 --> 00:02:00.734
&gt;&gt; Tomorrow Chinese president XI

00:02:01.134 --> 00:02:03.837
is traveling to Moscow to meet

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:05.906
with Putin, U.S. Furthers warn

00:02:06.039 --> 00:02:08.308
any proposal that comes out

00:02:08.442 --> 00:02:09.943
these talk would say likely

00:02:10.077 --> 00:02:10.777
favor Russians do you think

00:02:11.144 --> 00:02:13.146
China could change the dynamics

00:02:13.146 --> 00:02:13.713
of this war.

00:02:13.847 --> 00:02:19.686
&gt;&gt; I do not, Paula, the draft

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.055
peace proposal the Chinese

00:02:22.189 --> 00:02:23.557
already petitioned is all behind

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:25.459
the Russian attempts at gaining

00:02:25.592 --> 00:02:29.496
a cease fire, a freeze on the

00:02:29.629 --> 00:02:31.164
territory, which would create

00:02:31.198 --> 00:02:32.566
another frozen conflict.

00:02:32.699 --> 00:02:35.168
There are currently five frozen

00:02:35.168 --> 00:02:37.370
conflicts within Europe Russia

00:02:37.504 --> 00:02:38.605
created and I don't believe that

00:02:38.738 --> 00:02:39.339
certainly president zelenskyy or

00:02:39.473 --> 00:02:40.740
the Ukrainian people are going

00:02:41.174 --> 00:02:43.176
to abide by any kind of proposal

00:02:43.176 --> 00:02:44.511
that China gives in coordination

00:02:44.644 --> 00:02:45.345
with Russia.

00:02:45.479 --> 00:02:47.414
And what's interesting though,

00:02:47.547 --> 00:02:48.682
too, as you said, president XI

00:02:48.815 --> 00:02:52.752
is going to Moscow, he'll be

00:02:53.186 --> 00:02:54.254
shaking hands with the

00:02:54.387 --> 00:02:55.522
president, president Putin, few

00:02:55.655 --> 00:02:57.591
days after Putin was named by

00:02:57.724 --> 00:03:00.594
The Hague as a war criminal and

00:03:00.861 --> 00:03:02.762
a warrant issued for his arrest.

00:03:03.196 --> 00:03:04.431
I don't think that's good optics

00:03:04.564 --> 00:03:05.565
at all for the Chinese

00:03:05.699 --> 00:03:05.932
president.

00:03:06.066 --> 00:03:07.601
&gt;&gt; Shifting gear as bit,

00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:08.869
tomorrow is the 20th anniversary

00:03:09.202 --> 00:03:10.303
of the U.S. Invasion of Iraq,

00:03:10.437 --> 00:03:12.606
you for the only served but

00:03:12.739 --> 00:03:13.607
commanded army forces throughout

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:14.107
that war.

00:03:14.241 --> 00:03:19.946
What lessons have we learned in

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:21.615
the years since 2003

00:03:21.748 --> 00:03:22.782
&gt;&gt; It's great it's sort of the

00:03:23.216 --> 00:03:25.252
same lesson that is Ukrainian is

00:03:25.385 --> 00:03:27.220
learning truthfully.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:32.025
And not Denaro grading the

00:03:32.159 --> 00:03:33.593
soldiers I fought with who did

00:03:33.727 --> 00:03:35.562
masterfully in Iraq but the

00:03:35.695 --> 00:03:37.497
mission was convoluted and

00:03:37.631 --> 00:03:38.798
complex, there's a lot of people

00:03:39.232 --> 00:03:39.866
reflecting on that 20's years

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.802
later and saying what was our

00:03:43.236 --> 00:03:43.370
strategy?

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:45.605
What were we attempting to do?

00:03:45.739 --> 00:03:46.806
The intelligence was flawed

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:51.244
going into Iraq and there

00:03:51.244 --> 00:03:53.280
wasn't a very good end state

00:03:53.413 --> 00:03:54.281
other than to depose adam

00:03:54.414 --> 00:03:56.416
hussein as a dictator, the

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:57.817
biggest lesson I think a lot of

00:03:57.951 --> 00:03:59.619
people -- if they haven't

00:03:59.753 --> 00:04:01.354
learned they should, is don't go

00:04:01.488 --> 00:04:03.256
to war unless you have a very

00:04:03.256 --> 00:04:05.492
good strategy for what you're

00:04:05.625 --> 00:04:06.793
attempting to do and you have a

00:04:06.927 --> 00:04:08.595
very good preliminary end state

00:04:08.728 --> 00:04:10.130
for what you want to accomplish.

00:04:10.263 --> 00:04:11.698
Neither one of things were done

00:04:11.831 --> 00:04:14.601
in Iraq, and just like the

00:04:14.734 --> 00:04:16.503
Russians, also, I would harken

00:04:16.636 --> 00:04:17.938
back I was the war planner in

00:04:18.071 --> 00:04:21.274
the Pentagon when that war was

00:04:21.274 --> 00:04:21.541
planned.

00:04:21.675 --> 00:04:24.411
And actually stood up and said,

00:04:24.544 --> 00:04:25.979
there are not enough forces for

00:04:26.112 --> 00:04:26.880
this kind of operation and our

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.515
end state, objectives are not

00:04:28.648 --> 00:04:29.349
very clear.

00:04:29.482 --> 00:04:31.585
Truthfully, I think we learned a

00:04:31.718 --> 00:04:32.719
lot from that.

